      ⚡ 100% Free · 30+ Tested Business Templates
    </div>
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(26px, 4.5vw, 42px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--ink);">
      WhatsApp Business <strong style="color: var(--gm);">Auto Reply Generator</strong>
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--ink3); max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6;">
      Create professional, high-converting WhatsApp away messages, greeting replies, and customer service templates in seconds. Customize with your business details and copy with one tap.
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- CUSTOMIZER FORM BAR -->
