      <a href="https://socialninjas.in/contact?ref=linkwa_autoreply" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="padding: 12px 22px; background: #1F4B99; color: #fff; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(31,75,153,0.4); transition: transform 0.15s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.03)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
        Get Free AI Automation Audit →
